#
# ⚑⚑⚑ AND `UNVERIFIABLE` HAD TO BE SPLIT BEFORE THIS LINE COULD EXIST, because wiring it
# unsplit would have reproduced Ⓝ95 ⟡the-tracking-gaps — a blocking gate that fails a CLEAN
# CHECKOUT.  `paperkit.bib` needs `bibparse`, absent here.  Two cases arrive as the SAME
# `ModuleNotFoundError` and the gate now separates them by WHICH module the error names:
